step	1	-	After starting the quest
line	<str>I spoke to Hetty in her house at Rimmington. Hetty told me she could increase my magic power if I can bring her certain ingredients for a potion.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Hetty needs me to bring her the following:</col>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>An onion</col>, I could find one at <col=800000>Fred the Farmers farm</col>.</col>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>A rat's tail</col>, I could get one from a small rat.</col>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>A piece of burnt meat</col>, I could thoroughly cook a piece of raw beef.</col>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>An eye of newt</col>, maybe the <col=800000>Magic shop</col> in <col=800000>Port Sarim</col> would sell me this?</col>
line	(If carrying all four ingredients): <col=000080>I should take these ingredients to <col=800000>Hetty</col>.</col>
step	2	-	After giving Hetty all the ingredients
line	<str>I brought her an onion, a rat's tail, a piece of burnt meat and an eye of newt which she used to make a potion.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>I should drink from the <col=800000>cauldron</col> and improve my magic!</col>
